title:    How the implementation is organised
subtitle: Major directories only. Full source on GitHub.
width:    760
---
week-04-shared-vpc/
├── LAB.md              reproduction guide: the five roles, quota cascade, free-tier shape
├── terraform/          14 resources: hub VPC, subnets, attachment, firewall policy, spoke
├── scripts/            validate.sh - asserts all four free-tier conditions
└── docs/               figure plan, references, screenshots

# terraform/  "created" and "attached" are different things for a hierarchical
#             firewall policy, and only the second one filters anything.
# scripts/    four conditions keep this inside Always Free. Changing any one
#             of them silently starts billing, so all four are asserted.
